02:36:08,490 --> 02:36:10,190
Fuck, it didn't work, it didn't work.

2472
02:36:11,450 --> 02:36:12,670
Shit's unreliable.

2473
02:36:14,010 --> 02:36:16,350
Come on, come on, all of you.

2474
02:36:17,590 --> 02:36:18,770
