2484
02:36:44,020 --> 02:36:44,680
Come on.

2485
02:36:45,400 --> 02:36:47,180
Jump up, jump up.

2486
02:36:47,500 --> 02:36:47,820
Nice.

2487
02:36:48,320 --> 02:36:52,340
And now, slowly, slowly, inside the village.

2488
02:36:53,060 --> 02:36:54,140
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

2489
02:36:54,220 --> 02:36:55,060
