2504
02:37:21,810 --> 02:37:22,430
I apologize.

2505
02:37:23,450 --> 02:37:24,110
It's a mistake.

2506
02:37:24,370 --> 02:37:24,870
You're free.

2507
02:37:25,030 --> 02:37:25,490
Everyone's free.

2508
02:37:25,610 --> 02:37:25,730
Go.

2509
