2511
02:37:28,970 --> 02:37:29,510
Everybody?

2512
02:37:30,050 --> 02:37:31,170
Welcome everybody.

2513
02:37:31,710 --> 02:37:34,230
I mean, I guess you know your names internally here, but...

2514
02:37:34,250 --> 02:37:35,550
Immediately goes to bed.

2515
02:37:36,370 --> 02:37:37,130
I love it.

2516
02:37:37,670 --> 02:37:38,990
We have a door over here that's open.

2517
02:37:39,270 --> 02:37:41,850
I guess they can open their own doors, but, you know, just to be safe.

2518
02:37:42,530 --> 02:37:43,330
There you go.

2519
02:37:43,610 --> 02:37:44,910
You're gonna love this village.

2520
02:37:45,110 --> 02:37:46,910
Look, we even have a pumpkin head thingy.

2521
02:37:47,870 --> 02:37:48,650
With legs.

2522
02:37:48,950 --> 02:37:49,590
It's great.

2523
02:37:50,990 --> 02:37:51,770
Oh, man.

2524
02:37:51,770 --> 02:37:52,570
This is good.

2525
02:37:52,670 --> 02:37:54,050
I'm gonna go to sleep and grab more.

2526
02:37:54,290 --> 02:37:55,050
I'm not done.

2527
02:37:56,070 --> 02:37:56,850
I'm not done.

2528
02:37:58,070 --> 02:37:58,790
Uh, sleep.

2529
02:38:02,440 --> 02:38:03,280
Let's go!

2530
02:38:07,400 --> 02:38:08,780
We need even more!

2531
02:38:14,330 --> 02:38:15,230
Ah, keep it open.

2532
02:38:15,870 --> 02:38:19,810
Now, six leads, three boats, that's all I need.

2533
02:38:20,570 --> 02:38:22,810
And let's just hope everyone is still alive when I come back.

2534
02:38:25,290 --> 02:38:27,190
Wait, why did I just get... Oh, because I killed someone.

2535
02:38:27,890 --> 02:38:28,250
Right.

2536
02:38:29,430 --> 02:38:30,310
What are they doing?

2537
02:38:32,410 --> 02:38:34,450
What is happening up there that's so exciting, huh?

2538
02:38:37,470 --> 02:38:39,950
Maybe they're just enjoying... What is it with that house?

2539
02:38:52,630 --> 02:38:54,330
Guys, it's not allowed to be on the roof.

2540
02:38:54,530 --> 02:38:55,490
From now on, new rule.

2541
02:38:55,670 --> 02:38:56,470
No more roofing.

2542
02:38:57,930 --> 02:39:00,070
You cannot roof each other like this, okay?

2543
02:39:03,130 --> 02:39:03,890
Don't do it.

2544
02:39:06,150 --> 02:39:06,550
Whatever.

2545
02:39:07,070 --> 02:39:07,990
