2548
02:39:14,130 --> 02:39:17,930
You can bring a bunch of villagers to village, but you can't make the villagers village.

2549
02:39:23,110 --> 02:39:23,550
Okay.

2550
02:39:23,550 --> 02:39:25,650
Got one boat, and we got three other boats.

2551
02:39:26,310 --> 02:39:30,010
I think that may be enough villagers at the same village to grab even more.

2552
02:39:30,090 --> 02:39:30,970
Maybe even six more.

2553
02:39:31,350 --> 02:39:32,230
Oh, a lot there.

2554
02:39:39,870 --> 02:39:41,690
I'm not enjoying this right here in the water.

2555
02:39:43,150 --> 02:39:44,510
That enjoyment is negative.

2556
02:39:45,030 --> 02:39:46,110
Needs to be fixed.

2557
02:39:48,410 --> 02:39:50,950
Put it on the list of very many things to do.

2558
02:39:53,940 --> 02:39:58,260
Have I just discovered an issue with one of my beacons?

2559
02:39:59,920 --> 02:40:00,440
No.

2560
02:40:00,720 --> 02:40:01,380
They look perfect.

2561
02:40:01,780 --> 02:40:04,060
I thought maybe I forgot to crisscross the beams.

2562
02:40:05,340 --> 02:40:06,280
But I didn't.

2563
02:40:07,120 --> 02:40:09,260
Everything is taken care of.

2564
02:40:14,600 --> 02:40:16,500
I have never had this many villagers in my village.

2565
02:40:16,680 --> 02:40:17,500
It's kind of cool.

2566
02:40:18,200 --> 02:40:20,380
I also got to give them specific jobs and stuff.

2567
02:40:21,160 --> 02:40:22,840
And I got to make sure there's enough beds.

2568
02:40:23,020 --> 02:40:24,260
And I got to make sure there's enough food.

2569
02:40:25,200 --> 02:40:25,560
Amenities.

2570
02:40:25,780 --> 02:40:28,580
We got to have a ping pong table, you know.

2571
02:40:29,000 --> 02:40:29,960
Maybe some foosball.

2572
02:40:30,780 --> 02:40:33,640
But they need to be enjoying their time there as well.

2573
02:40:33,760 --> 02:40:35,020
It's not just all about work.

2574
02:40:35,160 --> 02:40:37,300
We need free time, you know.

2575
02:40:37,600 --> 02:40:39,020
We need to have hobbies, all of that.

2576
02:40:42,250 --> 02:40:43,410
Lots of amenities.

2577
02:40:44,830 --> 02:40:47,330
That is how you keep the populace happy.

2578
02:40:58,570 --> 02:40:59,030
Okay.

2579
02:41:00,290 --> 02:41:01,510
This is the challenge now.

2580
02:41:01,690 --> 02:41:06,870
I'm gonna try and bring six villagers back without breaking the lead once on one of them.

2581
02:41:07,830 --> 02:41:10,590
Actually an impossible challenge, but I'm gonna try it anyway.

2582
02:41:12,750 --> 02:41:14,810
Just go slow and don't fuck it up.

2583
02:41:17,770 --> 02:41:18,630
I can do it.

2584
02:41:29,120 --> 02:41:30,600
Awfully quiet here now, isn't it?

2585
02:41:31,400 --> 02:41:32,100
That's funny.

2586
02:41:33,360 --> 02:41:34,820
I guess, where is everybody?

2587
02:41:38,200 --> 02:41:39,180
That's so odd.

2588
02:41:42,080 --> 02:41:43,520
There's no way I took everyone!

2589
02:41:43,700 --> 02:41:44,200
Come on.

2590
02:41:47,640 --> 02:41:48,720
Ah, I see one.

2591
02:41:50,680 --> 02:41:51,680
See, he's sad now.

2592
02:41:51,820 --> 02:41:53,020
He's out in the field all alone.

2593
02:41:53,260 --> 02:41:54,000
He needs his friends.

2594
02:41:55,080 --> 02:41:55,720
Isn't that right?

2595
02:41:58,400 --> 02:42:01,320
I should probably bring people from over there over here first, and then together.

2596
02:42:02,060 --> 02:42:02,680
Oh, wait, wait, wait.

2597
02:42:02,800 --> 02:42:03,240
Ring the bell.

2598
02:42:03,340 --> 02:42:03,780
Ring the bell.

2599
02:42:03,920 --> 02:42:04,420
Where's the bell?

2600
02:42:09,670 --> 02:42:13,650
Ringing the bell will bring them all... No, wait, that will not bring them all to the yard, right?

2601
02:42:14,830 --> 02:42:16,670
That will bring them to their homes or whatever.

2602
02:42:19,310 --> 02:42:19,670
Cats!

2603
02:42:20,170 --> 02:42:21,310
Oh, I don't have any fish.

2604
02:42:22,530 --> 02:42:22,890
Shit.

2605
02:42:23,190 --> 02:42:24,410
Kind of wanted to bring cats as well.

2606
02:42:25,270 --> 02:42:25,930
Oh, you know what?

2607
02:42:26,010 --> 02:42:26,330
Thank you.

2608
02:42:26,530 --> 02:42:27,350
I'll take some bets.

2609
02:42:27,690 --> 02:42:31,350
You don't need these anymore anyway, so... I'ma grab them.

2610
02:42:34,340 --> 02:42:35,720
I don't like the yellow beds.

2611
02:42:35,800 --> 02:42:36,860
I think I hate the yellow beds.

2612
02:42:37,780 --> 02:42:40,680
I'm gonna give the yellow bed to the villagers I dislike the most.

2613
02:42:42,900 --> 02:42:46,320
And pretend that it's a very nice gift because it's made of gold, you know?

2614
02:42:46,680 --> 02:42:48,340
But in reality, it's a shit gift.

2615
02:42:48,660 --> 02:42:49,980
Because it's actually made of pee.

2616
02:42:52,000 --> 02:42:53,060
Yep, that's urine.

2617
02:42:55,320 --> 02:42:56,200
Colored with urine.

2618
02:42:57,820 --> 02:42:58,380
Ah, okay.

2619
02:43:00,830 --> 02:43:03,210
There's actually just one villager here, that's unreal.

2620
02:43:09,670 --> 02:43:16,290
Well, in that case, maybe I'll go to some other village and steal people.

2621
02:43:16,390 --> 02:43:17,270
I'll take you with me, though.

2622
02:43:17,810 --> 02:43:18,070
Come here.

2623
02:43:20,490 --> 02:43:21,790
We're going on a little trip.

2624
02:43:27,190 --> 02:43:28,070
Jump, jump.

2625
02:43:29,990 --> 02:43:32,490
Why won't you... Okay, there we go.

2626
02:43:36,430 --> 02:43:38,150
The lead will not break once.

2627
02:43:40,870 --> 02:43:43,430
I'm telling you, not a single time.

2628
02:44:01,650 --> 02:44:02,570
Keep an eye on them.

2629
02:44:03,650 --> 02:44:05,390
Everything's going according to plan.

2630
02:44:05,610 --> 02:44:06,690
Ah, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

2631
02:44:09,230 --> 02:44:09,970
There we go.

2632
02:44:12,010 --> 02:44:12,850
Slowly down.

2633
02:44:15,550 --> 02:44:15,910
Yeah.

2634
02:44:16,870 --> 02:44:17,970
Maybe there's a weight thing.

2635
02:44:18,090 --> 02:44:20,590
If there's two people in it, maybe it's harder to pull, you know?

2636
02:44:24,100 --> 02:44:25,680
Alright, and this should not break now.

2637
02:44:25,860 --> 02:44:27,740
As long as I'm on the open water, everything's fine.

2638
02:44:29,940 --> 02:44:31,060
Let's go to another village.

2639
02:44:31,200 --> 02:44:33,320
I know where there's another village where there's still a lot of people.

2640
02:44:33,620 --> 02:44:34,860
We're gonna grab everyone there.

2641
02:44:39,940 --> 02:44:43,680
So I believe it is still a bit this way, and then we're gonna turn that way.

2642
02:44:44,340 --> 02:44:45,340
So we're going north.

2643
02:44:49,080 --> 02:44:50,900
There's a village on the hills as well.

2644
02:44:51,040 --> 02:44:55,560
It's going to be a little bit of a bitch to grab the villagers there and coordinate the whole boat effort.

2645
02:44:57,140 --> 02:44:58,060
But it should be okay.

2646
02:45:00,820 --> 02:45:03,080
Oh wait, did I go too far?

2647
02:45:03,180 --> 02:45:03,560
No, it's fine.

2648
02:45:04,220 --> 02:45:04,760
Turning here.

2649
02:45:07,600 --> 02:45:09,980
Too bad I can't put a leash on the villagers, man.

2650
02:45:11,100 --> 02:45:13,760
Even though, I mean, it sounds bad, right?

2651
02:45:14,380 --> 02:45:15,680
To put a leash on them.

2652
02:45:15,880 --> 02:45:16,720
Like a dog.

2653
02:45:17,480 --> 02:45:17,880
But...

2654
02:45:24,690 --> 02:45:25,950
Why does it sound like that?

2655
02:45:28,270 --> 02:45:28,750
Huh?

2656
02:45:30,590 --> 02:45:32,070
The fuck is happening?

2657
02:45:33,190 --> 02:45:34,110
My goodness.

2658
02:45:39,290 --> 02:45:40,050
Where are you?

2659
02:45:41,170 --> 02:45:41,650
Oh!

2660
02:45:43,090 --> 02:45:44,070
Oh my goodness.

2661
02:45:44,410 --> 02:45:45,390
You're gonna die now.

2662
02:45:45,530 --> 02:45:46,190
You're gonna die now.

2663
02:45:46,310 --> 02:45:47,010
You're gonna die now.

2664
02:45:54,410 --> 02:45:54,910
Got him!

2665
02:45:55,630 --> 02:45:56,590
Air, air, air!

2666
02:45:56,950 --> 02:45:57,290
Woo!

2667
02:45:58,590 --> 02:46:01,230
Fucking hell, that noise scared the crap out of me.

2668
02:46:02,950 --> 02:46:04,490
Did he at least drop something for me?

2669
02:46:04,570 --> 02:46:05,290
Doesn't look like it.

2670
02:46:05,690 --> 02:46:06,110
Okay, whatever.

2671
02:46:07,510 --> 02:46:09,350
What the hell was that noise?

2672
02:46:12,500 --> 02:46:14,160
That is such a different voice.

2673
02:46:15,700 --> 02:46:16,480
Voice, noise.

2674
02:46:18,520 --> 02:46:19,520
Alright, are you okay?

2675
02:46:19,780 --> 02:46:20,840
You got hit, I saw that.

2676
02:46:20,960 --> 02:46:21,460
Here, get in.

2677
02:46:23,040 --> 02:46:25,440
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

2678
02:46:25,900 --> 02:46:26,380
Come here.

2679
02:46:28,740 --> 02:46:31,220
Get in, get, get in the boat.

2680
02:46:32,680 --> 02:46:33,480
There we go, nice.

2681
02:46:33,760 --> 02:46:34,140
Good job.

2682
02:46:36,860 --> 02:46:37,920
And we go like this.

2683
02:46:38,440 --> 02:46:40,100
Dude, I can actually bring seven people total.

2684
02:46:40,600 --> 02:46:41,460
I just realized.

2685
02:46:41,960 --> 02:46:44,060
One in my boat, two in every other.

2686
02:46:47,720 --> 02:46:50,200
Ayy... No, no, no, no, no, no.

2687
02:46:50,400 --> 02:46:51,620
Not that, not that, not that.

2688
02:46:54,180 --> 02:46:55,980
Wait, I can bring the boat underwater?!

2689
02:46:55,980 --> 02:46:58,160
Ayy?

2690
02:46:59,660 --> 02:47:00,500
How does that work?

2691
02:47:04,080 --> 02:47:04,940
That's not good.

2692
02:47:05,580 --> 02:47:07,020
That ain't good.

2693
02:47:07,980 --> 02:47:09,200
Something wrong about that.

2694
02:47:10,100 --> 02:47:11,680
Actually, right now I just need one boat.

2695
02:47:13,520 --> 02:47:14,000
Yeah.

2696
02:47:18,200 --> 02:47:20,300
Okay, so we're gonna go this way.

2697
02:47:20,820 --> 02:47:23,000
There should be a village straight up ahead here.

2698
02:47:30,430 --> 02:47:31,150
Stay there.

2699
02:47:32,710 --> 02:47:33,730
We got an issue.

2700
02:47:36,450 --> 02:47:37,470
Where are you, motherfucker?

2701
02:47:37,710 --> 02:47:38,110
There you are.

2702
02:47:42,070 --> 02:47:42,770
Oh, yeah?

2703
02:47:47,070 --> 02:47:47,610
Hoi!

2704
02:47:52,530 --> 02:47:53,070
Nice.

2705
02:47:56,160 --> 02:47:58,020
You may ask yourself, why did I kill that guy?

2706
02:47:58,620 --> 02:48:00,260
Because I have to go through here again.

2707
02:48:00,800 --> 02:48:04,820
And if I'm bringing seven people, that's disaster.

2708
02:48:05,880 --> 02:48:08,380
We've got to make sure the path is clean and clear.

2709
02:48:14,850 --> 02:48:15,210
Yeah.

2710
02:48:15,210 --> 02:48:16,110
Look at that beacon.

2711
02:48:16,650 --> 02:48:17,390
Isn't that lovely?

2712
02:48:18,610 --> 02:48:19,970
Wish it was a little higher, though.

2713
02:48:21,930 --> 02:48:23,610
Forgot to grab that gold over there, it seems.

2714
02:48:24,630 --> 02:48:26,010
I remember there is a portal.

2715
02:48:45,060 --> 02:48:46,500
Massive cave down there, it seems.

2716
02:48:48,060 --> 02:48:48,920
Underneath the water.

2717
02:48:52,180 --> 02:48:52,900
There it is.

2718
02:48:53,040 --> 02:48:53,720
That's the village.

2719
02:48:54,160 --> 02:48:55,980
I think there's still some people left there.

2720
02:48:56,220 --> 02:48:57,480
I already took a couple.

2721
02:48:57,700 --> 02:48:58,520
Maybe one or two.

2722
02:49:02,280 --> 02:49:04,400
Back when I only knew how to get one at a time.

2723
02:49:06,460 --> 02:49:07,880
Man, imagine that.

2724
02:49:08,060 --> 02:49:09,700
Fucking hell, getting ten people like that?

2725
02:49:09,880 --> 02:49:10,780
One at a time?

2726
02:49:13,140 --> 02:49:13,820
That's tough.

2727
02:49:14,260 --> 02:49:15,680
I'm glad I discovered this method.

2728
02:49:17,920 --> 02:49:19,780
Essentially, this is, like, infinitely many.

2729
02:49:20,080 --> 02:49:24,160
As long as you are willing to plop down, like, as many boats as you want, right?

2730
02:49:24,920 --> 02:49:28,840
Maybe it's gonna get a little crowded, but it can work, technically.

2731
02:49:32,600 --> 02:49:34,020
It's going to be annoying to get up there, though.

2732
02:49:34,240 --> 02:49:36,220
And they're all asleep now, probably, because it's the night.

2733
02:49:37,420 --> 02:49:39,480
Going to have to go to sleep as well and wake up.

2734
02:49:42,580 --> 02:49:44,080
That is the way we do it.

2735
02:49:51,650 --> 02:49:56,150
Part of me feels bad about... emptying whole villages.

2736
02:49:56,870 --> 02:50:00,670
You know, like... I like there being villages that are alive.

2737
02:50:01,730 --> 02:50:02,590
