Since you like it up there so much... You know how in real life, you put down paths, or the government does, or the local community?

3165
03:11:34,820 --> 03:11:36,580
And then people never follow those paths.

3166
03:11:36,760 --> 03:11:40,240
You always see what the real desire of the people is, after enough time.

3167
03:11:40,740 --> 03:11:42,100
It's called a desire path.

3168
