Of course you're going to be standing up there.

3288
03:16:33,250 --> 03:16:34,350
Why are you standing up there?

3289
03:16:34,430 --> 03:16:35,590
Is there something you're trying to get to?

3290
03:16:36,270 --> 03:16:37,650
Did I leave a...

3291
03:16:40,170 --> 03:16:42,790
Goddamn cartography table somewhere up on the roof or what?

3292
03:16:44,070 --> 03:16:44,510
Huh?

3293
03:16:46,350 --> 03:16:47,230
Come on.

3294
03:16:49,990 --> 03:16:50,430
No!

3295
03:16:53,070 --> 03:16:54,770
Come on, you're forced to take the job now.

3296
03:16:56,230 --> 03:16:57,270
You've got to take it.

3297
03:16:59,990 --> 03:17:01,290
That actually doesn't look too bad.

3298
03:17:04,230 --> 03:17:05,390
But I like this more.

3299
03:17:09,050 --> 03:17:10,170
Oh, he took it!

3300
03:17:11,490 --> 03:17:12,010
Riptide.

3301
03:17:13,310 --> 03:17:14,270
I'm good, bro.

3302
03:17:14,810 --> 03:17:15,270
Try again.

3303
03:17:16,010 --> 03:17:18,230
I need... I need mending.

3304
03:17:18,870 --> 03:17:20,130
Can you do that for me?

3305
03:17:21,370 --> 03:17:22,550
Mending is the way.

3306
03:17:22,850 --> 03:17:25,110
Hold on, I'm gonna try something very mean here.

3307
03:17:28,340 --> 03:17:35,980
Since he likes that spot so much... Sir... No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

3308
03:17:36,100 --> 03:17:37,060
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

3309
03:17:37,920 --> 03:17:38,500
Go in there.

3310
03:17:40,420 --> 03:17:41,000
Get in.

3311
03:17:43,340 --> 03:17:44,500
Maybe he knows what I'm up to.

3312
03:17:45,600 --> 03:17:45,880
Listen.

3313
03:17:47,360 --> 03:17:48,580
Now you don't want to stand on this, huh?

3314
03:17:54,280 --> 03:17:55,620
He's jumping on my bed now.

3315
03:17:56,020 --> 03:17:57,180
I guess I deserve it.

3316
03:17:57,320 --> 03:17:57,640
I know.

3317
03:17:57,800 --> 03:17:58,640
I hit him in the face.

3318
03:17:59,500 --> 03:17:59,900
Fine.

3319
03:18:00,580 --> 03:18:01,240
You're free.

3320
03:18:02,080 --> 03:18:03,140
But only for a week.

3321
03:18:03,240 --> 03:18:04,260
Then it's back to work, okay?

3322
03:18:05,320 --> 03:18:06,120
Now, the others.

3323
03:18:07,880 --> 03:18:08,620
Efficiency 4.

3324
03:18:08,720 --> 03:18:09,140
What are you doing?

3325
03:18:10,140 --> 03:18:10,720
Looting 2.

3326
03:18:10,800 --> 03:18:12,740
That's the guy I can't really change anyway.

3327
03:18:13,400 --> 03:18:16,180
How are people being fletchers here?

3328
03:18:16,200 --> 03:18:16,760
I don't understand.

3329
03:18:16,760 --> 03:18:18,100
I have no more fletching tables.

3330
03:18:19,300 --> 03:18:19,880
Do I?

3331
03:18:20,760 --> 03:18:21,680
I don't think so.

3332
03:18:22,710 --> 03:18:23,290
Wait a minute.

3333
03:18:23,950 --> 03:18:26,650
Maybe this serves as the fisherman's workbench.

3334
03:18:27,990 --> 03:18:29,530
That's what you would do as a fisherman, right?

3335
03:18:29,650 --> 03:18:30,390
Make a campfire.

3336
03:18:38,170 --> 03:18:39,170
No, he was gonna do it!

3337
03:18:45,180 --> 03:18:45,760
Remove this.

3338
03:18:47,540 --> 03:18:48,800
Did one of them lose their jobs?

3339
03:18:49,900 --> 03:18:51,260
Okay, so let me take a look here.

3340
03:18:51,380 --> 03:18:52,620
You are there.

3341
03:18:52,780 --> 03:18:53,300
I removed it.

3342
03:18:53,520 --> 03:18:54,540
Actually, I don't want to remove it.

3343
03:18:55,340 --> 03:18:56,260
I like it down there.

3344
03:18:59,240 --> 03:19:00,580
This is a mess, isn't it?

3345
03:19:01,820 --> 03:19:03,240
I kind of want to kill this guy.

3346
03:19:04,420 --> 03:19:05,460
I don't need this.

3347
03:19:06,260 --> 03:19:07,480
And you're kind of useless.

3348
03:19:07,980 --> 03:19:11,780
I'm sorry, but... It is what it is, you know?

3349
03:19:12,990 --> 03:19:14,690
You're dragging us all down here.

3350
03:19:17,490 --> 03:19:18,410
Fucking hell.

3351
03:19:21,450 --> 03:19:24,390
I don't know what to remove.

3352
03:19:26,270 --> 03:19:27,150
What are you?

3353
03:19:27,290 --> 03:19:28,130
You're the fisherman.

3354
03:19:28,570 --> 03:19:29,910
Where's your workbench?

3355
03:19:31,950 --> 03:19:34,170
It's so annoying that I can't figure that out.

3356
03:19:35,170 --> 03:19:37,810
What do I have that's equivalent to fishing?

3357
03:19:41,150 --> 03:19:42,890
Wait, oh, they're still upstairs here.

3358
03:19:47,730 --> 03:19:48,910
Get rid of the gate, I guess.

3359
03:19:51,770 --> 03:19:52,970
My inventory sucks.

3360
03:19:54,150 --> 03:19:54,690
Fix it.

3361
03:19:59,990 --> 03:20:00,950
Slaps can go in here.

3362
03:20:03,900 --> 03:20:04,760
Okay, you're upstairs.

3363
03:20:04,960 --> 03:20:05,440
I know that.

3364
03:20:06,440 --> 03:20:11,040
I feel like it's been issue after issue with these people ever since they moved in.

3365
03:20:12,560 --> 03:20:13,460
There we go, there we go.

3366
03:20:13,940 --> 03:20:14,400
Can't leave.

3367
03:20:15,020 --> 03:20:16,020
You're mine now.

3368
03:20:16,280 --> 03:20:16,700
You hear me?

3369
03:20:19,040 --> 03:20:22,840
And now... you are forced to work forever.

3370
03:20:24,060 --> 03:20:24,740
For me.

3371
03:20:27,060 --> 03:20:28,500
You're just gonna escape like that, huh?

3372
03:20:30,400 --> 03:20:30,800
No.

3373
03:20:31,240 --> 03:20:31,960
No, no, no, no, no.

3374
03:20:36,800 --> 03:20:37,480
Stop!

3375
03:20:37,480 --> 03:20:38,740
I will join you.

3376
03:20:39,480 --> 03:20:40,680
Ah, crap.

3377
03:20:41,580 --> 03:20:42,700
I shouldn't have done that.

3378
03:20:45,360 --> 03:20:46,640
Ah, whoops.

3379
03:20:50,020 --> 03:20:51,020
Give me the stair.

3380
03:20:53,520 --> 03:20:54,300
Oh, no.

3381
03:20:55,840 --> 03:20:56,940
How did I do this?

3382
03:20:57,240 --> 03:20:57,640
No!

3383
03:20:59,320 --> 03:20:59,860
Oh.

3384
03:21:01,100 --> 03:21:02,020
That's gotta be it.

3385
03:21:02,580 --> 03:21:03,480
Okay, now, work.

3386
03:21:04,980 --> 03:21:05,520
Work!

3387
03:21:09,900 --> 03:21:10,780
I remove this.

3388
03:21:11,020 --> 03:21:11,120
Ah!

3389
03:21:11,620 --> 03:21:12,020
Sorry.

3390
03:21:13,160 --> 03:21:14,680
I'm sorry you were in the way.

3391
03:21:15,200 --> 03:21:16,540
Okay, we're in here now together.

3392
03:21:16,820 --> 03:21:17,480
We're in it together.

3393
03:21:19,340 --> 03:21:21,520
I don't want to be here any more than you do.

3394
03:21:22,740 --> 03:21:24,920
If you work, we can be happy, okay?

3395
03:21:25,820 --> 03:21:26,220
Wait.

3396
03:21:27,440 --> 03:21:28,440
I got some idea.

3397
03:21:33,160 --> 03:21:34,320
Oh yeah, you wanna be there?

3398
03:21:34,440 --> 03:21:34,840
That's okay.

3399
03:21:37,720 --> 03:21:38,480
There we go.

3400
03:21:40,400 --> 03:21:41,040
Okay, now.

3401
03:21:44,760 --> 03:21:45,580
What you gonna do?

3402
03:21:46,600 --> 03:21:47,020
Huh?

3403
03:21:47,420 --> 03:21:48,040
Look at me.

3404
03:21:48,760 --> 03:21:49,480
You wanna work?

3405
03:21:49,820 --> 03:21:51,080
Or you wanna stay in here forever?

3406
03:21:53,880 --> 03:21:54,460
Come on.

3407
03:21:55,160 --> 03:21:56,000
Make your choice.

3408
03:21:58,700 --> 03:22:00,340
I'm gonna count to ten and then I'm leaving.

3409
03:22:01,360 --> 03:22:03,120
You can think about what you've done.

3410
03:22:04,400 --> 03:22:04,840
Okay?

3411
03:22:07,300 --> 03:22:08,220
How do I get out?

3412
03:22:12,140 --> 03:22:13,260
No, no, no, no, no, no.

3413
03:22:13,520 --> 03:22:14,420
You work now.

3414
03:22:15,880 --> 03:22:16,900
Get to work.

3415
03:22:17,800 --> 03:22:19,100
I swear to God.

3416
03:22:20,480 --> 03:22:21,400
Okay, you know what?

3417
03:22:22,140 --> 03:22:22,740
I'm sorry.

3418
03:22:22,980 --> 03:22:23,820
Here's a potato for you.

3419
03:22:25,040 --> 03:22:26,000
You want that, right?

3420
03:22:29,140 --> 03:22:31,280
Bro, I'm losing my mind.

3421
03:22:32,380 --> 03:22:34,060
I'm gonna try and give him all kinds of food now.

3422
03:22:39,200 --> 03:22:40,840
Maybe some sugar will cheer him up.

3423
03:22:41,160 --> 03:22:45,460
It's not allowed usually in this place, but maybe this will do the trick.

3424
03:22:47,500 --> 03:22:48,500
Lure him with candy.

3425
03:22:48,860 --> 03:22:51,780
I'm starting to sound like a real kidnapper, aren't I?

3426
03:22:53,560 --> 03:22:54,380
Sugar for you.

3427
03:23:02,080 --> 03:23:02,780
Be happy.

3428
03:23:04,460 --> 03:23:05,320
Brett, where's the Brett?

3429
03:23:05,460 --> 03:23:05,540
There.

3430
03:23:11,280 --> 03:23:12,440
How about a raw potato?

3431
03:23:14,000 --> 03:23:15,440
Why isn't he working?

3432
03:23:15,500 --> 03:23:16,300
I don't understand.

3433
03:23:17,640 --> 03:23:18,160
Work!

3434
03:23:20,260 --> 03:23:22,220
There's nothing else for you to do down here.

3435
03:23:22,520 --> 03:23:23,320
Come on!

3436
03:23:26,350 --> 03:23:27,210
Brother man.

3437
03:23:28,510 --> 03:23:29,750
Now I can't leave.

3438
03:23:32,030 --> 03:23:33,130
I'm finna kill you.

3439
03:23:33,970 --> 03:23:35,630
I'm going to murder you.

3440
03:23:35,850 --> 03:23:36,630
You hear me?

3441
03:23:36,970 --> 03:23:38,290
I'm already halfway there.

3442
03:23:38,430 --> 03:23:39,670
I punched you twice.

3443
03:23:40,530 --> 03:23:41,890
You thought that was an accident?

3444
03:23:42,450 --> 03:23:43,170
Think again.

3445
03:23:44,150 --> 03:23:45,110
It wasn't.

3446
03:23:50,400 --> 03:23:51,100
Okay, you know what?

3447
03:23:51,180 --> 03:23:51,580
Get out of my bed.

3448
03:23:51,940 --> 03:23:52,680
I gotta sleep.

3449
03:23:53,300 --> 03:23:55,860
I'm actually losing my mind about this.

3450
03:23:57,220 --> 03:23:58,140
I can't take it.

3451
03:24:02,040 --> 03:24:02,960
Okay, it's a new day.

3452
03:24:03,080 --> 03:24:03,380
Come on.

3453
03:24:04,340 --> 03:24:05,860
Forget and forgive, right?

3454
03:24:07,580 --> 03:24:08,240
One of you.

3455
03:24:15,440 --> 03:24:17,300
You know what the worst part about this is?

3456
03:24:18,060 --> 03:24:21,540
There's no consistency at all in how this system works.

3457
03:24:22,720 --> 03:24:24,580
Like, why are they not going here?

3458
03:24:24,660 --> 03:24:25,320
There's two!

3459
03:24:26,440 --> 03:24:27,300
Come on!

3460
03:24:31,040 --> 03:24:31,900
There we go.

3461
03:24:32,120 --> 03:24:32,860
Thank you.

3462
03:24:32,980 --> 03:24:33,700
Thank you.

3463
03:24:33,840 --> 03:24:34,720
Can you be like this guy?

3464
03:24:36,200 --> 03:24:37,200
Now remove this.

3465
03:24:39,680 --> 03:24:41,120
Look, he's willing to work.

3466
03:24:43,540 --> 03:24:46,880
What the fuck are you guys doing in this spot?

3467
03:24:49,020 --> 03:24:49,920
Okay, that's it.

3468
03:24:50,320 --> 03:24:51,100
No more betting.

3469
03:24:57,720 --> 03:24:58,840
Are they looking at that?

3470
03:24:59,780 --> 03:25:00,760
Ah, there we go.

3471
03:25:00,960 --> 03:25:01,560
Thank you, sir.

3472
03:25:01,840 --> 03:25:03,240
Aw, it's the wrong answer, though.

3473
03:25:03,820 --> 03:25:04,360
Try again.

3474
03:25:08,520 --> 03:25:08,960
Nice!

3475
03:25:09,240 --> 03:25:09,600
What do you got?

3476
03:25:11,120 --> 03:25:11,980
Blast protection?

3477
03:25:12,220 --> 03:25:13,280
Nah, I don't think so.

3478
03:25:14,540 --> 03:25:15,440
Grab another one.

3479
03:25:15,600 --> 03:25:16,300
There we go.

3480
03:25:16,840 --> 03:25:18,420
Luck of the C3!

3481
03:25:24,140 --> 03:25:25,420
I mean, it's not bad.

3482
03:25:27,060 --> 03:25:29,180
And I already have a fishing rod, right?

3483
03:25:29,280 --> 03:25:30,720
So I don't technically need that right now.

3484
03:25:31,860 --> 03:25:32,620
Nice try, though.

3485
03:25:33,160 --> 03:25:33,600
Nice try.

3486
03:25:36,520 --> 03:25:37,340
Give me those eggs.

3487
03:25:45,740 --> 03:25:46,500
Efficiency one.

3488
03:25:49,600 --> 03:25:50,880
Bro, can you give me mending?

3489
03:25:53,580 --> 03:25:54,380
There, two of them.

3490
03:25:57,060 --> 03:25:57,680
Come on.

3491
03:26:00,140 --> 03:26:00,540
Again?

3492
03:26:01,320 --> 03:26:01,980
You know what?

3493
03:26:02,080 --> 03:26:03,840
It's probably just because it's a very rare one.

3494
03:26:05,060 --> 03:26:05,400
Yay!

3495
03:26:05,940 --> 03:26:06,720
Two of them that are doing it.

3496
03:26:06,840 --> 03:26:08,720
Loyalty 3 and Depth Strider.

3497
03:26:11,620 --> 03:26:12,960
Alright, now we're rolling.

3498
03:26:14,680 --> 03:26:17,860
Oh, this... Ooh, projectile protection 4.

3499
03:26:18,520 --> 03:26:19,460
Sharpness 4, yo!

3500
03:26:20,500 --> 03:26:22,700
Damn, these are both really good.

3501
03:26:24,360 --> 03:26:28,800
Oh my, I don't... Nah, I'm gonna keep going.

3502
03:26:29,740 --> 03:26:31,720
I mean, if I can get him now, I can get him again, right?

3503
03:26:32,980 --> 03:26:33,720
Punch one?

3504
03:26:34,660 --> 03:26:36,440
Oh, I'm doing so fast right now.

3505
03:26:38,580 --> 03:26:39,260
Come on!

3506
03:26:42,380 --> 03:26:43,540
Bookshelf, emeralds.

3507
03:26:44,820 --> 03:26:45,560
Five... Oh!

3508
03:26:47,580 --> 03:26:48,940
That's a really good one.

3509
03:26:49,880 --> 03:26:52,180
I'm actually considering buying that right now.

3510
03:26:53,020 --> 03:26:54,280
How much money do I have?

3511
03:26:54,720 --> 03:26:55,120
Two.

3512
03:26:55,440 --> 03:26:56,160
I have two?

3513
03:26:57,520 --> 03:26:58,480
There's no way.

3514
03:26:58,700 --> 03:27:00,040
I must have more than that.

3515
03:27:03,660 --> 03:27:04,800
Dude, I'm broke!

3516
03:27:08,640 --> 03:27:09,280
Oh no!

3517
03:27:09,600 --> 03:27:11,420
Even if I got mending, I couldn't buy it.

3518
03:27:18,620 --> 03:27:19,400
Okay, fuck it.

3519
03:27:20,600 --> 03:27:22,040
How am I gonna get a lot of money?

3520
03:27:25,680 --> 03:27:26,400
Using villagers.

3521
03:27:28,380 --> 03:27:28,740
Right?

3522
03:27:29,100 --> 03:27:30,660
I trade them things to get like this.

3523
03:27:30,800 --> 03:27:34,940
Like, I have a ton of paper, but in this case, I don't want to use paper because it's kind of valuable to me.

3524
03:27:35,880 --> 03:27:39,140
But essentially, I want to actually earn money by trading with these people.

3525
03:27:43,500 --> 03:27:44,220
Sharpness 4.

3526
03:27:45,100 --> 03:27:45,900
Looting 3!

3527
03:27:46,960 --> 03:27:49,440
Yo, that's a big one.

3528
03:27:51,260 --> 03:27:52,620
I feel like you should stay.

3529
03:27:54,400 --> 03:27:55,220
I like you.

3530
03:27:55,340 --> 03:27:55,900
You get to stay.

3531
03:27:57,520 --> 03:27:58,500
Now it's only you.

3532
03:27:59,460 --> 03:28:02,320
This guy is still holding a grudge, it seems.

3533
03:28:05,160 --> 03:28:08,420
Bro... Why do they actually want to be here so bad?

3534
03:28:08,540 --> 03:28:09,800
In this exact spot.

3535
03:28:10,900 --> 03:28:12,420
Isn't that really weird?

3536
03:28:13,960 --> 03:28:15,940
Also, I just realized my roof is fucked.

3537
03:28:17,340 --> 03:28:18,520
It was angled wrong.

3538
03:28:20,360 --> 03:28:22,200
Oh no, that's gonna be annoying to repair.

3539
03:28:24,480 --> 03:28:25,120
Here's this.

3540
03:28:25,680 --> 03:28:26,940
Move out of the way, move out of the way.

3541
03:28:29,480 --> 03:28:30,160
Come on.

3542
03:28:30,880 --> 03:28:31,580
There we go.

3543
03:28:31,880 --> 03:28:32,120
No!

3544
03:28:33,600 --> 03:28:34,760
Jesus Christ!

3545
03:28:37,860 --> 03:28:39,040
I hate this!

3546
03:28:39,610 --> 03:28:40,610
Fuck off!

3547
03:28:41,030 --> 03:28:41,850
Get down!

3548
03:28:44,090 --> 03:28:48,710
Of all the places in the entire world, you're gonna stand right fucking there.

3549
03:28:48,930 --> 03:28:49,610
On that block.

3550
03:28:50,050 --> 03:28:50,670
Two of you.

3551
03:28:51,310 --> 03:28:51,930
Why?

3552
03:28:54,410 --> 03:28:55,930
You're taunting me now.

3553
03:28:56,130 --> 03:28:56,690
Thank you.

3554
03:28:57,730 --> 03:28:58,650
Wrong, though.

3555
03:28:59,070 --> 03:28:59,410
Wrong.

3556
03:29:01,750 --> 03:29:02,390
Wrong!

3557
03:29:03,250 --> 03:29:04,070
Come on.

3558
03:29:05,830 --> 03:29:07,510
Alright, are you gonna let me do my thing?

3559
03:29:11,660 --> 03:29:12,380
Brother!

3560
03:29:12,380 --> 03:29:13,420
Piss off!

3561
03:29:14,120 --> 03:29:15,840
Are you kidding me?!

3562
03:29:15,840 --> 03:29:18,900
What is happening?!

3563
03:29:18,900 --> 03:29:21,320
What is happening in this game?!

3564
03:29:21,320 --> 03:29:25,080
I'm losing my mind!

3565
