And we got, well, I guess five now.

4101
03:58:05,000 --> 03:58:07,380
One, two, three, four, five villagers in total.

4102
03:58:07,540 --> 03:58:09,160
And they're all sort of hanging out in the town square.

4103
03:58:09,320 --> 03:58:09,980
It's actually amazing.

4104
03:58:10,560 --> 03:58:11,200
Wonderful stuff.

4105
03:58:12,440 --> 03:58:15,160
One of them had to go, unfortunately, because he misbehaved.

4106
03:58:15,680 --> 03:58:16,640
But it is what it is.

4107
03:58:18,340 --> 03:58:20,240
I'm gonna go to the perfect spot.

4108
03:58:22,400 --> 03:58:23,580
And I'm gonna chill here for a bit.

4109
03:58:24,020 --> 03:58:24,800
Thank you so much.

4110
03:59:18,150 --> 03:59:19,630
God damn it, I was muted.

4111
03:59:19,990 --> 03:59:24,210
I did a whole speech just now and I told the funniest jokes you've ever heard.

4112
03:59:25,070 --> 03:59:26,170
All that is lost.

4113
03:59:26,630 --> 03:59:27,530
Lost in time.

4114
03:59:28,890 --> 03:59:30,410
Like tears in the rain.

4115
03:59:31,490 --> 03:59:32,170
They're gone.

4116
03:59:33,690 --> 03:59:37,810
Basically, I was saying that this felt a lot like coding today.

4117
03:59:38,930 --> 03:59:40,330
Something was wrong in the code.

4118
03:59:40,470 --> 03:59:42,950
I kept getting some kind of error message that made no sense.

4119
03:59:43,560 --> 03:59:47,660
And I was looking, looking, looking, until I finally found a stupid-ass bug.

4120
03:59:49,140 --> 03:59:51,240
Which was the damn barrel.

4121
03:59:53,220 --> 03:59:54,340
That's what that felt like.

4122
03:59:56,600 --> 03:59:57,860
But you know what?

4123
03:59:58,020 --> 03:59:59,960
It felt good in the end, solving that bug.

4124
04:00:00,120 --> 04:00:00,920
Like it always does.

4125
04:00:06,870 --> 04:00:07,950
Forgot the end of that speech.

4126
04:00:08,150 --> 04:00:08,670
Time to die.

4127
04:00:08,890 --> 04:00:10,470
You're right, actually, pirate girl.

4128
04:00:11,170 --> 04:00:12,650
Thank you for catching that reference.

4129
04:00:13,450 --> 04:00:15,070
I can't stop referencing that one.

4130
04:00:16,870 --> 04:00:18,190
Well, whenever it makes sense.

4131
04:00:21,110 --> 04:00:25,010
If doors have an on and off state, what state would it be when closed and open?

4132
04:00:26,550 --> 04:00:27,550
That's a good question.

4133
04:00:29,470 --> 04:00:30,850
Few people have an answer for that.

4134
04:00:34,280 --> 04:00:36,240
The mysterious fletching table remains.

4135
04:00:36,720 --> 04:00:37,800
Oh yeah, you're right.

4136
04:00:38,000 --> 04:00:39,220
We gotta find a fletching table.

4137
04:00:39,400 --> 04:00:41,100
Someone is making arrows.

4138
04:00:42,580 --> 04:00:44,160
Someone out there is making arrows.

4139
04:00:44,380 --> 04:00:45,240
And I can't have it.

4140
04:00:48,900 --> 04:00:50,180
Kidnapping, exploiting, slavery.

4141
04:00:50,480 --> 04:00:52,920
You mentioned that one encounter with that girl with the shovel?

4142
04:00:56,620 --> 04:00:57,300
That was a joke.

4143
04:00:58,820 --> 04:00:59,880
I am reading chat.

4144
04:01:00,200 --> 04:01:00,860
What's up, man?

4145
04:01:02,240 --> 04:01:02,620
LilVantam253.

4146
04:01:03,440 --> 04:01:04,820
I'm in love with your Minecraft series.

4147
04:01:04,920 --> 04:01:05,620
Love the supercut.

4148
04:01:05,760 --> 04:01:06,160
Thank you.

4149
04:01:06,480 --> 04:01:07,460
I'm glad you like it.

4150
04:01:07,580 --> 04:01:08,580
And welcome to the stream.

4151
04:01:12,500 --> 04:01:15,200
It felt like finding workarounds on someone else's code.

4152
04:01:16,940 --> 04:01:17,460
Yeah!

4153
04:01:18,220 --> 04:01:19,740
That's exactly what it felt like.

4154
04:01:22,120 --> 04:01:23,020
You nailed it.

4155
04:01:25,360 --> 04:01:30,900
Oliver, your patience with Elden Ring versus... Wait, that just went away from me.

4156
04:01:31,540 --> 04:01:34,640
Oh, your patience with Elden Ring versus Minecraft is stark, is it?

4157
04:01:36,320 --> 04:01:37,660
Meaning that...

4158
04:01:39,160 --> 04:01:42,000
I am more patient in Minecraft or Elden Ring.

4159
04:01:42,100 --> 04:01:45,620
I can't honestly tell because I've been very patient today trying to figure this out.

4160
04:01:49,080 --> 04:01:50,900
I feel like I am very patient.

4161
04:01:51,060 --> 04:01:55,000
Last time I spent a whole four hours trying to figure out how to make redstone work.

4162
04:02:00,270 --> 04:02:00,670
KrustyRadDog.

4163
04:02:02,450 --> 04:02:04,330
A while ago you said you were full-time.

4164
04:02:04,450 --> 04:02:04,830
Is this true?

4165
04:02:04,970 --> 04:02:05,470
It is true.

4166
04:02:05,610 --> 04:02:07,130
I am a full-time streamer right now.

4167
04:02:07,990 --> 04:02:08,890
And guess what?

4168
04:02:08,990 --> 04:02:11,170
I am actually earning enough to pay the rent.

4169
04:02:12,390 --> 04:02:19,630
If this keeps going as is right now, or if it gets better, I can actually keep doing this indefinitely right now.

4170
04:02:19,830 --> 04:02:20,930
Which is kind of insane.

4171
04:02:21,150 --> 04:02:22,430
I mean, it's not a glamorous life.

4172
04:02:22,710 --> 04:02:25,870
I have enough to, you know, sustain myself with groceries and all that.

4173
04:02:26,470 --> 04:02:27,570
But it can work.

4174
04:02:27,880 --> 04:02:28,880
It actually works.

4175
04:02:29,380 --> 04:02:29,860
Yeah.

4176
04:02:32,460 --> 04:02:33,240
Bro, how?

4177
04:02:33,440 --> 04:02:35,500
I'm living in a very small space right now.

4178
04:02:36,260 --> 04:02:37,460
In the middle of nowhere.

4179
04:02:38,080 --> 04:02:39,000
Very, very low rent.

4180
04:02:44,180 --> 04:02:46,280
Will you have enough rent for the big house with the cat?

4181
04:02:46,420 --> 04:02:49,560
That's the thing, I'm trying to find a cheap place where I can actually afford it.

4182
04:02:50,340 --> 04:02:51,800
So I'm being patient with that.

4183
04:02:53,120 --> 04:02:59,180
It's not like I'm super actively looking, it's just like a couple times a week I will look at some webpages, see if there's a good offer, you know?

4184
04:03:04,540 --> 04:03:06,280
Is there any way to donate to you and stream?

4185
04:03:06,580 --> 04:03:07,780
I think there is.

4186
04:03:08,700 --> 04:03:10,900
I'm honestly not sure what the best way to do it is.

4187
04:03:11,800 --> 04:03:14,020
I would say probably through Patreon.

4188
04:03:14,640 --> 04:03:18,260
But if you want some benefits during the stream and stuff, I would suggest just subscribing.

4189
04:03:18,780 --> 04:03:23,060
That way you get no ads and you also get some emotes and, you know, all that stuff.

4190
04:03:28,490 --> 04:03:29,650
Yes, but they take a cut.

4191
04:03:29,750 --> 04:03:30,150
That's true.

4192
04:03:30,310 --> 04:03:31,710
I mean, you can't really get around that.

4193
04:03:32,910 --> 04:03:38,350
I mean, I technically do have a PayPal thing, but I haven't advertised this anywhere.

4194
04:03:39,650 --> 04:03:41,290
So do you not enjoy your astrophysics?

4195
04:03:41,470 --> 04:03:43,010
I'm thinking of going into a similar field.

4196
04:03:43,830 --> 04:03:45,030
Well, I am enjoying it.

4197
04:03:45,130 --> 04:03:46,070
Well, I did enjoy it.

4198
04:03:47,190 --> 04:03:49,970
But now I had this opportunity in front of me, so I thought of doing that.

4199
04:03:52,520 --> 04:03:58,460
But there are definitely certain things about doing astrophysics that are not as glamorous as you may think, you know?

4200
04:03:58,680 --> 04:04:01,260
A lot of it is... coding.

4201
04:04:02,280 --> 04:04:09,120
You know, I had this romantic idea many years ago that I'd be sitting on a mountaintop looking through a lens, you know?

4202
04:04:09,260 --> 04:04:12,600
Looking at the stars, feeling the cold breeze of the night.

4203
04:04:13,480 --> 04:04:14,760
It's not like that anymore.

4204
04:04:15,140 --> 04:04:20,140
Nowadays you sit in a cold office in Denmark, you press a keyboard button...

4205
04:04:20,430 --> 04:04:24,410
And a telescope in Chile is gonna rotate, you know, and do all the work for you.

4206
04:04:24,490 --> 04:04:25,470
In fact, that's not even true.

4207
04:04:25,750 --> 04:04:29,470
You put in a work order and some guy in Chile who sits there is gonna do it for you.

4208
04:04:29,870 --> 04:04:31,530
All via computers, you know?

4209
04:04:35,410 --> 04:04:36,110
Wait, what happened?

4210
04:04:38,510 --> 04:04:39,550
Yo, Meeps!

4211
04:04:40,150 --> 04:04:40,910
Holy shit!

4212
04:04:42,070 --> 04:04:45,350
20 subs were gifted to the community, thank you so much, man!

4213
04:04:48,210 --> 04:04:49,390
That is insane.

4214
04:04:51,810 --> 04:04:52,650
Thank you.

4215
04:04:53,170 --> 04:04:57,330
For those that don't know, Meep's kitten has been to space.

4216
04:04:58,090 --> 04:05:00,590
An actual astronaut in the chat, not kidding.

4217
04:05:03,820 --> 04:05:04,640
Freakin' awesome.

4218
04:05:06,840 --> 04:05:09,040
Hey Oliver, I'm from Chile, I have been in Alma.

4219
04:05:09,180 --> 04:05:10,280
That's awesome rational!

4220
04:05:10,960 --> 04:05:12,320
I've always wanted to go there.

4221
04:05:12,600 --> 04:05:14,260
But that's so high up though, right?

4222
04:05:14,360 --> 04:05:16,340
You need to have, like, breathing apparatus.

4223
04:05:17,120 --> 04:05:18,480
Some oxygen or something, right?

4224
04:05:19,900 --> 04:05:20,660
Was it nice?

4225
04:05:22,680 --> 04:05:23,360
Yeah, yeah.

4226
04:05:23,940 --> 04:05:24,600
Actually true.

4227
04:05:27,120 --> 04:05:31,160
I think you went up there with, uh... Oh, was it blue something?

4228
04:05:32,790 --> 04:05:33,710
Briefly, but yeah.

4229
04:05:33,890 --> 04:05:34,650
Yeah, it's awesome.

4230
04:05:34,890 --> 04:05:35,570
It's so cool.

4231
04:05:38,710 --> 04:05:39,610
Which space?

4232
04:05:40,270 --> 04:05:41,270
Are there multiple?

4233
04:05:41,930 --> 04:05:44,430
I mean, I guess we have normal space and liminal space.

4234
04:05:44,810 --> 04:05:47,650
I'm doubting that he went to liminal space.

4235
04:05:48,410 --> 04:05:50,810
I'm not joking, Francesco.

4236
04:05:54,530 --> 04:05:55,810
Yep, low O2.

4237
04:05:59,200 --> 04:06:00,360
I want to go to Chile.

4238
04:06:01,600 --> 04:06:08,780
I want to go to that one hotel in the middle of the desert that they shot Quantum of Solace in.

4239
04:06:09,240 --> 04:06:13,760
That is used as a resort for astronomers staying there doing observations.

4240
04:06:20,260 --> 04:06:21,720
You finally plugged the hole.

4241
04:06:21,840 --> 04:06:23,360
I plugged multiple holes today.

4242
04:06:23,800 --> 04:06:26,260
Today was a big ol' hole-plugging stream.

4243
04:06:27,500 --> 04:06:29,040
Is this stream post-recorded?

4244
04:06:29,060 --> 04:06:29,380
It is.

4245
04:06:29,680 --> 04:06:31,800
I record everything after the fact.

4246
04:06:32,140 --> 04:06:34,500
When this stream is done, I'm gonna start recording it.

4247
04:06:36,080 --> 04:06:37,020
Nothing is real.

4248
04:06:40,120 --> 04:06:43,320
We have someone who watches space and someone who went to space, yeah?

4249
04:06:44,500 --> 04:06:45,240
That's true.

4250
04:06:54,240 --> 04:07:00,900
A very frustrating thing, but also the reason why I continue to follow you is the number of times you make discoveries and relevant reflections that you forget.

4251
04:07:01,220 --> 04:07:01,880
Oh no.

4252
04:07:02,360 --> 04:07:03,500
Wait, are you being serious?

4253
04:07:03,740 --> 04:07:05,060
Is that a good or bad thing?

4254
04:07:06,780 --> 04:07:07,760
I will be honest.

4255
04:07:08,740 --> 04:07:13,080
I think me talking out loud... and it's not me coping or anything right now.

4256
04:07:13,200 --> 04:07:14,260
I'm saying it as it is, okay?

4257
04:07:14,680 --> 04:07:15,120
100%.

4258
04:07:15,120 --> 04:07:15,640
Rule 12.

4259
04:07:16,700 --> 04:07:20,180
When I talk out loud, I tend to forget things that I thought about before.

4260
04:07:20,980 --> 04:07:22,280
This wouldn't happen...

4261
04:07:22,480 --> 04:07:26,780
I'm 100% sure, and I know this, because I know myself, when I play games by myself.

4262
04:07:27,620 --> 04:07:33,800
Like, when I'm playing World of Warcraft on my own, I'm not, like, going, oh, shit, I'm going to Blackrock Depths now, right?

4263
04:07:33,860 --> 04:07:38,980
And on the way, I'm getting distracted, like, oh, shit, let me go do this instead and forget about the group, or whatever.

4264
04:07:40,240 --> 04:07:45,000
It's totally because I'm talking out loud, it does something to me, and maybe it's something that can be learned over time.

4265
04:07:45,760 --> 04:07:50,120
Maybe it's a learning process, but no matter what, I'm having a blast.

4266
04:07:50,520 --> 04:07:51,060
Doing this.

4267
04:07:51,220 --> 04:07:52,760
I mean, I love talking out loud.

4268
04:07:52,880 --> 04:07:54,220
That also has its advantages.

4269
04:07:55,120 --> 04:08:00,060
Oftentimes, I theorize about things more than I usually would because I'm talking out loud.

4270
04:08:01,880 --> 04:08:04,680
So it's a bit of a mixed bag there, you know?

4271
04:08:05,580 --> 04:08:09,860
But if you can find enjoyment in that as well, that's awesome.

4272
04:08:11,500 --> 04:08:12,100
Yo, Chris!

4273
04:08:12,960 --> 04:08:14,460
Gifted a lot of subs as well.

4274
04:08:14,620 --> 04:08:15,500
Five subs as well.

4275
04:08:15,940 --> 04:08:17,020
Thank you so much.

4276
04:08:17,690 --> 04:08:20,730
And also everyone else that subbed throughout this stream.

4277
04:08:21,010 --> 04:08:22,970
I see you in the activity feed.

4278
04:08:23,910 --> 04:08:24,830
Thank you, guys.

4279
04:08:29,530 --> 04:08:32,050
It's when you forget what you're doing when you walk through a door.

4280
04:08:34,210 --> 04:08:42,330
I mean... Like I said... Usually I say something on the way up, you know, when I come from the basement.

4281
04:08:43,250 --> 04:08:47,050
And then in the process of me saying that, I forgot the real reason why I went up.

4282
04:08:47,450 --> 04:08:49,410
Hasn't that happened to you guys in real life as well?

4283
04:08:50,390 --> 04:08:51,990
You're like, oh shit, I gotta do this.

4284
04:08:52,090 --> 04:08:54,630
Then you go to the other room and you arrive there and you're like, wait.

4285
04:08:55,230 --> 04:08:56,210
Why did I come here?

4286
04:08:56,680 --> 04:09:01,200
And then you go back to the original room, and you start thinking, wait, how did I think?

4287
04:09:01,800 --> 04:09:03,940
Such that I wanted to go to the other room.

4288
04:09:05,720 --> 04:09:07,860
Imagine that, but like amplified in this game.

4289
04:09:09,720 --> 04:09:12,820
There's definitely some sort of memory wiping field.

4290
04:09:13,580 --> 04:09:16,460
Like that flash from Men in Black happening on the way.

4291
04:09:18,940 --> 04:09:21,360
Oliver, don't forget to do the ad thing when you take your breaks.

4292
04:09:21,560 --> 04:09:22,340
You're so right.

4293
04:09:22,600 --> 04:09:24,420
I think I forgot this time around.

4294
04:09:25,580 --> 04:09:34,480
But actually, I did do one at the very beginning, before the stream started, such that when I actually started playing, there would be no ads in the pre-roll for a while.

4295
04:09:34,760 --> 04:09:36,080
So that one I didn't forget.

4296
04:09:36,640 --> 04:09:38,780
But I definitely forgot to play ads during the break.

4297
04:09:38,880 --> 04:09:39,380
I should have done it.

4298
04:09:40,140 --> 04:09:43,800
Otherwise, the ads will autoplay during gameplay, which is even worse, right?

4299
04:09:45,480 --> 04:09:47,980
Guys, this is so much fun.

4300
04:09:48,100 --> 04:09:49,340
I fucking love doing this.

4301
04:09:49,460 --> 04:09:50,340
I love Minecraft.

4302
04:09:50,660 --> 04:09:52,700
I can't wait to play more Elden Ring as well.

4303
04:09:53,100 --> 04:09:55,440
And look forward to more Cyberpunk as well.

4304
04:09:55,580 --> 04:09:58,480
Those three games right now... I'm in gaming heaven, guys.

4305
04:09:58,780 --> 04:09:59,700
I can't tell you.

4306
04:10:00,000 --> 04:10:00,720
This is great.

4307
04:10:00,960 --> 04:10:01,740
I'm loving it.

4308
04:10:02,140 --> 04:10:03,660
Having a good ol' time.

4309
04:10:04,460 --> 04:10:05,700
I'm gonna see you next time.

4310
04:10:05,880 --> 04:10:08,620
Which is probably gonna be... Let's see, today's Monday.

4311
04:10:09,620 --> 04:10:10,600
Tuesday, tomorrow.

4312
04:10:11,460 --> 04:10:12,900
Either... I think Wednesday.

4313
04:10:13,200 --> 04:10:14,460
We're gonna have a stream Wednesday.

4314
04:10:14,860 --> 04:10:15,220
Elden Ring.

4315
04:10:15,360 --> 04:10:15,800
Or tomorrow.

4316
04:10:16,120 --> 04:10:17,440
Either tomorrow or Wednesday.

4317
04:10:17,980 --> 04:10:18,800
It depends.

4318
04:10:19,660 --> 04:10:20,800
But look forward to that.

4319
04:10:21,200 --> 04:10:21,640
Okay.

4320
04:10:22,140 --> 04:10:22,820
Goodnight, everybody.

4321
04:10:23,360 --> 04:10:24,280
Thanks for watching.

4322
04:10:25,500 --> 04:10:27,340
And join the Discord if you haven't yet.

4323
04:10:28,100 --> 04:10:28,660
Ciao.

